= |S|\left(\sum_{(i, j)\in \mu^*} (a_{i, j} - x_i - x_j) - \sum_{\substack{ k \in N,\\ (k, \cdot )\notin \mu^*,\\ (\cdot , k) \notin \mu^*}} x_k \right) \, .
